{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"egg_basket","model_identifier":"egg_basket","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## egg_basket\n\nCarried load, animal goods.\n\n- Cubes: 11 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.8..3.8, y -9.0..1.0, z -3.2..3.2 (size 7.5 x 10.0 x 6.5 u = 21 x 28 x 18 cm).\nEgg basket: a small wicker basket (~20 cm) lined with straw and full of eggs, hanging from its arched handle; the handle top passes through the fist just above the grip. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 9.0.\n"},"description":"## egg_basket\n\nCarried load, animal goods.\n\n- Cubes: 11 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.8..3.8, y -9.0..1.0, z -3.2..3.2 (size 7.5 x 10.0 x 6.5 u = 21 x 28 x 18 cm).\nEgg basket: a small wicker basket (~20 cm) lined with straw and full of eggs, hanging from its arched handle; the handle top passes through the fist just above the grip. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 9.0.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"basket","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.5,-9.0,-3.0],"to":[3.5,-4.0,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[22,0,29.0,5.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[7,7,13.0,12.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,7,7.0,12.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[13,7,19.0,12.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[8,0,15.0,6.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[15,0,22.0,6.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"0d2a5ecb-8988-5f7d-a877-984bbccc7656"},{"name":"rim","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":